2. Separate example module: examples/adka2a
================================================================================

examples/adka2a is a standalone Go module and is NOT part of the SDK's
dependency graph; it exists only to demonstrate A2A interoperability. Its direct
dependencies are:

  - google.golang.org/adk (adk-go)  Apache License 2.0
  - google.golang.org/genai         Apache License 2.0
  - github.com/a2aproject/a2a-go/v2 Apache License 2.0

These are consumed as libraries through their public APIs; no source from them
is copied into the SDK. The full transitive graph is recorded in
examples/adka2a/go.sum; generate its report with:
    (cd examples/adka2a && go-licenses report ./...)

